  "details": "Description\n\nI have Discord set to not share my VRchat activity, but it will still show I'm playing VRC despite the show game toggle being off.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIt happens every time you open the game and you have to toggle the show game switch on and off again in Discord to fix it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-5de5614b49-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
